Lex["0299"] = "'Achiyra` {akh-ee-rah'}|AV - Ahira 5; 5|from 0251 and 07451||noun proper masculine|<br><br>Ahira = \"my brother is evil\"<BR> INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a chief of Naphtali <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1488;&#1458;&#1495;&#1460;&#1497;&#1512;&#1463;&#1506;</span> &#700;&#259;ch&#238;yra&#699;, akh-ee-rah&#39;; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=251&page=1\">H251</a> and Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=7451&page=1\">H7451</a>; brother of wrong; Achira, an Israelite:&#8212;Ahira.";
