Lex["0622"] = "'acaph {aw-saf'}|AV - together 51, gather 86, assemble 15, rereward 5, misc 51; 200|A primitive root|TWOT - 140|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to gather, receive, remove, gather in INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to gather, collect INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to gather (an individual into company of others) INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to bring up the rear INDENT7--<b>4)</b> to gather and take away, remove, withdraw INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Niphal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to assemble, be gathered INDENT7--<b>2)</b> (pass of Qal 1a2) INDENT12-- <b>a)</b> to be gathered to one's fathers INDENT12-- <b>b)</b> to be brought in or into (association with others) INDENT7--<b>3)</b> (pass of Qal 1a4) INDENT12-- <b>a)</b> to be taken away, removed, perish INDENT3--<b>c)</b> (Piel) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to gather (harvest) INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to take in, receive into INDENT7--<b>3)</b> rearguard, rearward (substantive) INDENT3--<b>d)</b> (Pual) to be gathered INDENT3--<b>e)</b> (Hithpael) to gather oneself or themselves <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1488;&#1464;&#1505;&#1463;&#1507;</span> &#700;&#226;&#231;aph, aw-saf&#39;; a primitive root; to gather for any purpose; hence, to receive, take away, i.e. remove (destroy, leave behind, put up, restore, etc.):&#8212;assemble, bring, consume, destroy, felch, gather (in, together, up again), <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> generally, get (him), lose, put all together, receive, recover (another from leprosy), (be) rereward, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> surely, take (away, into, up), <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> utterly, withdraw.";
