Lex["0624"] = "'acuph {aw-soof'}|AV - Asuppim 2, threshold 1; 3|passive participle of 0622|TWOT - 140c|noun masculine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> what is gathered, store, storing, storehouse INDENT0--<b>2)</b> (CLBL) threshold (metonomy) <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1488;&#1464;&#1505;&#1467;&#1507;</span> &#700;&#226;&#231;uph, aw-soof&#39;; passive participle of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=622&page=1\">H622</a>; collected (only in the plural), i.e. a collection of offerings:&#8212;threshold, Asuppim.";
