Lex["0629"] = "'ocparna' (Aramaic) {os-par-naw'}|AV - speedily 4, speed 1, fast 1, forthwith 1; 7|of Persian derivation|TWOT - 2594|adverb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> thoroughly INDENT0--<b>2)</b> (CLBL) eagerly, diligently <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1488;&#1479;&#1505;&#1456;&#1508;&#1468;&#1463;&#1512;&#1456;&#1504;&#1464;&#1488;</span> &#700;o&#231;parn&#226;&#700;, os-par-naw&#39;; (Aramaic) of Persian derivation; diligently:&#8212;fast, forthwith, speed(-ily).";
