Lex["0637"] = "'aph {af}|AV - also, even, yet, moreover, yea, with, low, therefore, much; 17|a primitive particle|TWOT - 142|conjunction (denoting addition, esp of something greater), adverb|<br><br>conjunction (denoting addition, esp of something greater)<BR><b>1)</b> also, yea, though, so much the more<br><br>adverb<BR><b>2)</b> furthermore, indeed <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1488;&#1463;&#1507;</span> &#700;aph, af; a primitive particle; meaning accession (used as an adverb or conjunction); also or yea; adversatively though:&#8212;also, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">+</a></b></sup> although, and (furthermore, yet), but, even, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">+</a></b></sup> ow much less (more, rather than), moreover, with, yea.";
