Lex["0759"] = "'armown {ar-mone'}|AV - palace 31, castle 1; 32|from an unused root (meaning to be elevated)|TWOT - 164a|noun masculine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> citadel, palace, fortress <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1488;&#1463;&#1512;&#1456;&#1502;&#1493;&#1465;&#1503;</span> &#700;arm&#244;wn, ar-mone'; from an unused root (meaning to be elevated); a citadel (from its height):&#8212;castle, palace. Compare Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=2038&page=1\">H2038</a>.";
