Lex["0818"] = "'ashem {aw-shame'}|AV - guilty 2, faulty 1; 3|from 0816|TWOT - 180a|adjective| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> guilty, faulty (and obliged to offer a guilt-offering) <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1488;&#1464;&#1513;&#1473;&#1461;&#1501;</span> &#700;&#226;sh&#234;m, aw-shame&#39;; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=816&page=1\">H816</a>; guilty; hence, presenting a sin-offering:&#8212;one which is faulty, guilty.";
