Lex["0840"] = "'Asar'el {as-ar-ale'}|AV - Asareel 1; 1|by orthographical variation from 0833 and 0410||noun proper masculine|<br><br>Asareel = \"God holds\"<BR> INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a descendant of Judah through Caleb <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1488;&#1458;&#1513;&#1474;&#1463;&#1512;&#1456;&#1488;&#1461;&#1500;</span> &#700;&#259;sar&#700;&#234;l, as-ar-ale&#39;; by orthographical variation from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=833&page=1\">H833</a> and Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=410&page=1\">H410</a>; right of God; Asarel, an Israelite:&#8212;Asareel.";
