Lex["0860"] = "'athown {aw-thone'}|AV - ass 34; 34|probably from the same as 0386 (sense of patience)|TWOT - 190a|noun feminine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> she-ass, she-donkey <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1488;&#1464;&#1514;&#1493;&#1465;&#1503;</span> &#700;&#226;th&#244;wn, aw-thone&#39;; probably from the same as Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=386&page=1\">H386</a> (in the sense of patience); a female donkey (from its docility):&#8212;(she) ass.";
