Lex["01158"] = "ba`ah {baw-aw'}|AV - enquire 2, boil 1, sought up 1, swelling out; 5|A primitive root|TWOT - 259|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to seek out, swell, cause to swell, boil up, enquire INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to seek, enquire INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to cause to boil up INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Niphal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to be searched out INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to be swelling, bulging, swelling out <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1489;&#1468;&#1464;&#1506;&#1464;&#1492; </span>  b&#226;&#699;&#226;h, baw-aw&#39;; a primitive root; to gush over, i.e. to swell; (figuratively) to desire earnestly; by implication to ask:&#8212;cause, inquire, seek up, swell out.";
