Lex["01214"] = "batsa` {baw-tsah'}|AV - cut me off 2, gained 2, given 2, greedy 2, coveteth 1, covetous 1,<BR>cut 1, finish 1, fulfilled 1, get 1, performed 1, wounded 1; 16|A primitive root|TWOT - 267|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to cut off, break off, gain by unrighteous violence, get, finish, be covetous, be greedy INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to cut off INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to stop INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to gain wrongfully or by violence INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Piel) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to cut off, sever INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to finish, complete, accomplish INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to violently make gain of <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1489;&#1468;&#1464;&#1510;&#1463;&#1506; </span>  b&#226;tsa&#699;, baw-tsah&#39;; a primitive root to break off, i.e. (usually) plunder; figuratively, to finish, or (intransitively) stop:&#8212;(be) covet(-ous), cut (off), finish, fulfill, gain (greedily), get, be given to (covetousness), greedy, perform, be wounded.";
