Lex["01238"] = "baqaq {baw-kah'}|AV - empty 5, make void 1, emptiers 1, fail 1, utterly (inf for<BR>emphasis; 9|A primitive root|TWOT - 273|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to empty INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to empty, lay waste INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to make void (fig.) INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Niphal) to be emptied INDENT3--<b>c)</b> (Polel) to empty out, devastate <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1489;&#1468;&#1464;&#1511;&#1463;&#1511; </span>  b&#226;qaq, baw-kah&#39;; a primitive root; to pour out, i.e. to empty, figuratively, to depopulate; by analogy, to spread out (as a fruitful vine):&#8212;(make) empty (out), fail, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> utterly, make void.";
