Lex["02181"] = "zanah {zaw-naw'}|AV - ...harlot 36, go a whoring 19, ...whoredom 15, whore 11,<BR>commit fornication 3, whorish 3, harlot + 0802 2, commit 1,<BR>continually 1, great 1, whore's + 0802 1; 93|a primitive root [highly-fed and therefore wanton]|TWOT - 563|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to commit fornication, be a harlot, play the harlot INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to be a harlot, act as a harlot, commit fornication INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to commit adultery INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to be a cult prostitute INDENT7--<b>4)</b> to be unfaithful (to God) (fig.) INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Pual) to play the harlot INDENT3--<b>c)</b> (Hiphil) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to cause to commit adultery INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to force into prostitution INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to commit fornication <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1494;&#1464;&#1504;&#1464;&#1492; </span>  z&#226;n&#226;h, zaw-naw&#39;; a primitive root [highly fed and therefore wanton]; to commit adultery (usually of the female, and less often of simple fornication, rarely of involuntary ravishment); figuratively, to commit idolatry (the Jewish people being regarded as the spouse of Jehovah):&#8212;(cause to) commit fornication, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> continually, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> great, (be an, play the) harlot, (cause to be, play the) whore, (commit, fall to) whoredom, (cause to) go a-whoring, whorish.";
