Lex["02648"] = "chaphaz {khaw-faz'}|AV - haste 3, to haste 3, make haste 2, tremble 1; 9|A primitive root|TWOT - 708|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to hurry, flee, hasten, fear, be terrified INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) to be in a hurry, be alarmed INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Niphal) to be in a hurry <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1495;&#1464;&#1508;&#1463;&#1494; </span> ch&#226;phaz, khaw-faz&#39;; a primitive root; properly, to start up suddenly, i.e. (by implication) to hasten away, to fear:&#8212;(make) haste (away), tremble.";
