Lex["02654"] = "chaphets {khaw-fates'}|AV - delight 39, please 14, desire 9, will 3, pleasure 3, favour 2,<BR>like 2, moveth 1, would 1, at all 1; 75|A primitive root|TWOT - 712,713|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to delight in, take pleasure in, desire, be pleased with INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> of men INDENT12-- <b>a)</b> to take pleasure in, delight in INDENT12-- <b>b)</b> to delight, desire, be pleased to do INDENT7--<b>2)</b> of God INDENT12-- <b>a)</b> to delight in, have pleasure in INDENT12-- <b>b)</b> to be pleased to do INDENT0--<b>2)</b> to move, bend down INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) to bend down <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1495;&#1464;&#1508;&#1461;&#1509; </span> ch&#226;ph&#234;ts, khaw-fates&#39;; a primitive root; properly, to incline to; by implication (literally but rarely) to bend; figuratively, to be pleased with, desire:&#8212;<sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> any at all, (have, take) delight, desire, favour, like, move, be (well) pleased, have pleasure, will, would.";
