Lex["02942"] = "t@`em (Aramaic) {teh-ame'}|AV - decree 13, chancellor + 01169 3, commanded + 07761 3, regarded 1,<BR>commandment 2, regard + 07761, tasted 1, wisdom 1; 25|from 02939, and equivalent to 02941|TWOT - 2757a|noun masculine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> decree, taste, judgment, command INDENT3--<b>a)</b> taste INDENT3--<b>b)</b> judgment, discretion INDENT3--<b>c)</b> report INDENT3--<b>d)</b> command <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1496;&#1456;&#1506;&#1461;&#1501;</span> &#7789;&#7497;&#699;&#234;m, teh-ame'; (Aramaic) from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=2939&page=1\">H2939</a>, and equivalent to Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=2941&page=1\">H2941</a>; properly, flavor; figuratively, judgment (both subjective and objective); hence, account (both subjectively and objectively):&#8212; chancellor, command, commandment, decree, regard, taste, wisdom.";
