Lex["02947"] = "tephach {tay'-fakh}|AV - hand breath 3, coping 1; 4|from 02946|TWOT - 818b|noun masculine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> span, width of the hand, hand breadth INDENT3--<b>a)</b> a unit of measurement, measurement of length INDENT0--<b>2)</b> coping (an architectural term) <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1496;&#1461;&#1508;&#1463;&#1495; </span> &#7789;&#234;phach, tay&#39;-fakh; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=2946&page=1\">H2946</a>; a spread of the hand, i.e. a palm-breadth (not &#39;span&#39; of the fingers); architecturally, a corbel (as a supporting palm):&#8212;coping, hand-breadth.";
