Lex["02961"] = "tariy {taw-ree'}|AV - new 1, putrifying 1; 2|from an unused root apparently meaning to be moist|TWOT - 824a|adjective feminine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> fresh, new <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1496;&#1464;&#1512;&#1460;&#1497; </span> &#7789;&#226;r&#238;y, taw-ree&#39;; from an unused root apparently meaning to be moist; properly, dripping; hence, fresh (i.e. recently made such):&#8212;new, putrefying.";
