Lex["02973"] = "ya'al {yaw-al'}|AV - foolishly 1, fool 1, foolish 1, dote 1; 4|A primitive root|TWOT - 830|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to be foolish, become fools, act foolishly, show wicked folly INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Niphal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to show wicked folly INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to become fools <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1497;&#1464;&#1488;&#1463;&#1500; </span> y&#226;&#700;al, yaw-al&#39;; a primitive root; properly, to be slack, i.e. (figuratively) to be foolish:&#8212;dote, be (become, do) foolish(-ly).";
