Lex["03069"] = "Y@hovih {yeh-ho-vee'}|AV - GOD 304, LORD 1; 305|a variation of 03068 [used after 0136, and pronounced by Jews as 0430, in order to prevent the repetition of the same sound, since they elsewhere pronounce 03068 as 0136]||noun proper deity| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> Jehovah - used primarily in the combination 'Lord Jehovah' INDENT3--<b>a)</b> equal to 03068 but pointed with the vowels of 0430 <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1497;&#1456;&#1492;&#1465;&#1493;&#1460;&#1492; </span> Y&#7497;h&#244;vih, yeh-ho-vee&#39;; a variation of Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=3068&page=1\">H3068</a> [used after Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=136&page=1\">H136</a>, and pronounced by Jews as Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=430&page=1\">H430</a>, in order to prevent the repetition of the same sound, since they elsewhere pronounce Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=3068&page=1\">H3068</a> as Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=136&page=1\">H136</a>]:&#8212;God.";
