Lex["03072"] = "Y@hovah tsidqenuw {ye-ho-vaw' tsid-kay'-noo}|AV - LORD our Righteousness 2; 2|from 03068 and 06664 with pronominal suffix||noun proper masculine|Jehovah is our righteousness<BR> INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a sacred name symbolically applied to Jerusalem and the Messiah <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1510;&#1460;&#1491;&#1456;&#1511;&#1461;&#1504;&#1493; &#1497;&#1456;&#1492;&#1465;&#1493;&#1464;&#1492;</span> Y&#7497;h&#244;v&#226;h tsidq&#234;n&#251;w, ye-ho-vaw&#39; tsid-kay&#39;-noo; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=3068&page=1\">H3068</a> and Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=6664&page=1\">H6664</a> with pronominal suffix; Jehovah (is) our right; Jehovah-Tsidkenu, a symbolical epithet of the Messiah and of Jerusalem:&#8212;the Lord our righteousness.";
