Lex["03313"] = "yapha` {yaw-fah'}|AV - shine 4, shine forth 2, shew thyself 1, light 1; 8|A primitive root|TWOT - 892|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to shine, shine forth or out, cause to shine, send out beams INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Hiphil) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to shine out, shine forth, send out beams INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to cause to shine <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1497;&#1464;&#1508;&#1463;&#1506;</span>  y&#226;pha&#699;, yaw-fah&#39;; a primitive root; to shine:&#8212;be light, shew self, (cause to) shine (forth).";
