Lex["03381"] = "yarad {yaw-rad'}|AV - (come, go, etc) down 340, descend 18, variant 2, fell 2, let 1,<BR>abundantly 1, down by 1, indeed 1, put off 1, light off 1,<BR>out 1, sank 1, subdued 1, take 1; 380|A primitive root|TWOT - 909|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to go down, descend, decline, march down, sink down INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to go or come down INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to sink INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to be prostrated INDENT7--<b>4)</b> to come down (of revelation) INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Hiphil) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to bring down INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to send down INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to take down INDENT7--<b>4)</b> to lay prostrate INDENT7--<b>5)</b> to let down INDENT3--<b>c)</b> (Hophal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to be brought down INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to be taken down <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1497;&#1464;&#1512;&#1463;&#1491; </span> y&#226;rad, yaw-rad&#39;; a primitive root; to descend (literally, to go downwards; or conventionally to a lower region, as the shore, a boundary, the enemy, etc.; or figuratively, to fall); causatively, to bring down (in all the above applications):&#8212;<sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> abundantly, bring down, carry down, cast down, (cause to) come(-ing) down, fall (down), get down, go(-ing) down(-ward), hang down, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> indeed, let down, light (down), put down (off), (cause to, let) run down, sink, subdue, take down.";
