Lex["03462"] = "yashen {yaw-shane'}|AV - sleep 16, remained long 1, old 1, old store 1; 19|A primitive root|TWOT - 928|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to sleep, be asleep INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) to sleep, go to sleep, be asleep INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Niphal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to remain a long time, be stored up INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to be festering (of leprosy) INDENT3--<b>c)</b> (Piel) to cause to sleep, entice to sleep <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1497;&#1464;&#1513;&#1473;&#1461;&#1503;</span> y&#226;sh&#234;n, yaw-shane&#39;; a primitive root; properly, to be slack or languid, i.e. (by implication) sleep (figuratively, to die); also to grow old, stale or inveterate:&#8212;old (store), remain long, (make to) sleep.";
