Lex["03467"] = "yasha` {yaw-shah'}|AV - save 149, saviour 15, deliver 13, help 12, preserved 5,<BR>salvation 3, avenging 2, at all 1, avenged 1, defend 1,<BR>rescue 1, safe 1, victory 1; 205|A primitive root|TWOT - 929|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to save, be saved, be delivered INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Niphal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to be liberated, be saved, be delivered INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to be saved (in battle), be victorious INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Hiphil) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to save, deliver INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to save from moral troubles INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to give victory to <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1497;&#1464;&#1513;&#1473;&#1463;&#1506;</span> y&#226;sha&#699;, yaw-shah&#39;; a primitive root; properly, to be open, wide or free, i.e. (by implication) to be safe; causatively, to free or succor:&#8212;<sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> at all, avenging, defend, deliver(-er), help, preserve, rescue, be safe, bring (having) salvation, save(-iour), get victory.";
