Lex["03654"] = "ken {kane}|AV - lice 6, manner 1; 7|from 03661 in the sense of fastening|TWOT - 999a|noun masculine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> gnat, gnats, gnat-swarm <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1499;&#1468;&#1461;&#1503;</span> k&#234;n, kane; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=3661&page=1\">H3661</a> in the sense of fastening; (from infixing its sting; used only in plural (and irregular in Exodus 8:17,18; Hebrews 13:14)) a gnat:&#8212;lice, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> manner.";
