Lex["03780"] = "kasah {kaw-saw'}|AV - covered 1; 1|A primitive root|TWOT - 1049|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> (Qal) to become sated, be gorged with food <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1499;&#1468;&#1464;&#1513;&#1474;&#1464;&#1492;</span>  k&#226;s&#226;h, kaw-saw'; a primitive root; to grow fat (i.e. be covered with flesh):&#8212;be covered. Compare Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=3680&page=1\">H3680</a>.";
