Lex["03887"] = "luwts {loots}|AV - scorner 14, scorn 4, interpreter 2, mocker 2, ambassadors 1,<BR>derision 1, mock 1, scornful 1, teachers 1; 27|A primitive root|TWOT - 1113|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to scorn, make mouths at, talk arrogantly INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to boast INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to scorn INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Hiphil) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to mock, deride INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to interpret (language) INDENT12-- <b>a)</b> interpreter (participle) INDENT12-- <b>b)</b> ambassador (fig.) INDENT3--<b>c)</b> (Hithpalpel) to be inflated, scoff, act as a scorner, show oneself a mocker <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\">&#1500;&#1493;&#1468;&#1509;</span>  l&#251;wts, loots; a primitive root; properly, to make mouths at, i.e. to scoff; hence (from the effort to pronounce a foreign language) to interpret, or (generally) intercede:&#8212;ambassador, have in derision, interpreter, make a mock, mocker, scorn(-er, -ful), teacher.";
