Lex["04042"] = "magan {maw-gan'}|AV - deliver 3; 3|a denominative from 04043|TWOT - 367e|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> (Piel) to deliver up, give, deliver <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\">&#1502;&#1464;&#1490;&#1463;&#1503;</span> m&#226;gan, maw-gan&#39;; a denominative from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=4043&page=1\">H4043</a>; properly, to shield; encompass with; figuratively, to rescue, to hand safely over (i.e. surrender):&#8212;deliver.";
