Lex["04044"] = "m@ginnah {meg-in-naw'}|AV - sorrow 1; 1|from 04042|TWOT - 367d|noun feminine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> covering INDENT3--<b>a)</b> covering, obstinacy, blindness (of the heart) <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\">&#1502;&#1456;&#1490;&#1460;&#1504;&#1468;&#1464;&#1492;</span>  m&#7497;ginn&#226;h, meg-in-naw'; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=4042&page=1\">H4042</a>; a covering (in a bad sense), i.e. blindness or obduracy:&#8212;sorrow. See also Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=4043&page=1\">H4043</a>.";
