Lex["04116"] = "mahar {maw-har'}|AV - haste 42, swift 3, quickly 3, hastily 2, hasty 2, soon 2, speed 2,<BR>headlong 1, rash 1, fearful 1, ready 1, shortly 1, speedily 1,<BR>straightway 1, suddenly 1; 64|A primitive root|TWOT - 1152|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> (Qal) to hasten INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Niphal) to be hurried, be anxious<BR> INDENT7--<b>1)</b> hasty, precipitate, impetuous INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Piel) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to hasten, make haste INDENT7--<b>2)</b> hasten (used as adverb with another verb) INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to hasten, prepare quickly, do quickly, bring quickly <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\">&#1502;&#1464;&#1492;&#1463;&#1512;</span>  m&#226;har, maw-har&#39;; a primitive root; properly, to be liquid or flow easily, i.e. (by implication); to hurry (in a good or a bad sense); often used (with another verb) adverbially, promptly:&#8212;be carried headlong, fearful, (cause to make, in, make) haste(-n, -ily), (be) hasty, (fetch, make ready) <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> quickly, rash, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> shortly, (be so) <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> soon, make speed, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> speedily, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> straightway, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> suddenly, swift.";
