Lex["04260"] = "machama'ah {makh-am-aw-aw'}|AV - butter 1; 1|a denominative from 02529|TWOT - 1182|noun feminine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> curd-like, smooth, unctuous, hypocritical INDENT3--<b>a)</b> words of flattery (fig.) <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\">&#1502;&#1463;&#1495;&#1458;&#1502;&#1464;&#1488;&#1464;&#1492;</span>  mach&#259;m&#226;&#700;&#226;h, makh-am-aw-aw&#39;; a denominative from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=2529&page=1\">H2529</a>; something buttery (i.e. unctuous and pleasant), as (figuratively) flattery:&#8212;<sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> than butter.";
