Lex["04324"] = "Miykal {me-kawl'}|AV - Michal 18; 18|apparently the same as 04323||noun proper feminine|<br><br>Michal = \"who is like God\"<BR> INDENT0--<b>1)</b> daughter of king Saul, sister of Jonathan, wife of king David, and mother of five; given to David as wife for the bride price of 100 Philistine foreskins; while still married to David, her father gave her in marriage to another, Phaltiel; at the death of Saul, David forced her to return <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\">&#1502;&#1460;&#1497;&#1499;&#1464;&#1500;</span>  M&#238;yk&#226;l, me-kawl&#39;; apparently the same as Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=4323&page=1\">H4323</a>; revulet; Mikal, Saul&#39;s daughter:&#8212;Michal.";
