Lex["04900"] = "mashak {maw-shak'}|AV - draw 15, draw out 3, prolonged 3, scattered 2, draw along 1,<BR>draw away 1, continue 1, deferred 1, misc 9; 36|A primitive root|TWOT - 1257|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to draw, drag, seize INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to draw (and lift out), drag along, lead along, drag or lead off, draw down INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to draw (the bow) INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to proceed, march INDENT7--<b>4)</b> to draw out or give (a sound) INDENT7--<b>5)</b> to draw out, prolong, continue INDENT7--<b>6)</b> to trail (seed in sowing)<BR> INDENT7--<b>7)</b> to cheer, draw, attract, gratify INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Niphal) to be drawn out INDENT3--<b>c)</b> (Pual) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to be drawn out, be postponed, be deferred INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to be tall <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1502;&#1464;&#1513;&#1473;&#1463;&#1498;&#1456; </span> m&#226;shak, maw-shak&#39;; a primitive root; to draw, used in a great variety of applications (including to sow, to sound, to prolong, to develop, to march, to remove, to delay, to be tall, etc.):&#8212;draw (along, out), continue, defer, extend, forbear, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> give, handle, make (pro-, sound) long, <sup><b><a href=\"#strongs-legend\">X</a></b></sup> sow, scatter, stretch out.";
