Lex["04902"] = "Meshek {meh'-shek}|AV - Meshech 8, Mesech 1; 9|the same in form as 04901, but probably of foreign derivation||noun proper masculine|<br><br>Mesech or Meshech = \"drawing out\"<BR> INDENT0--<b>1)</b> son of Japheth, grandson of Noah, and progenitor of peoples to the north of Israel INDENT3--<b>a)</b> descendants of Mesech often mentioned in connection with Tubal, Magog, and other northern nations including the Moschi, a people on the borders of Colchis and Armenia <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1502;&#1462;&#1513;&#1473;&#1462;&#1498;&#1456; </span> Meshek, meh&#39;-shek; the same in form as Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=4901&page=1\">H4901</a>, but probably of foreign derivation; Meshek, a son of Japheth, and the people descended from him:&#8212;Mesech, Meshech.";
