Lex["04932"] = "mishneh {mish-neh'}|AV - second 11, double 8, next 7, college 2, copy 2, twice 2,<BR>fatlings 1, much 1, second order 1; 35|from 08138|TWOT - 2421c|noun masculine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> double, copy, second, repetition INDENT3--<b>a)</b> double INDENT3--<b>b)</b> copy (of law) INDENT3--<b>c)</b> second (in order) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> second rank INDENT7--<b>2)</b> second in age INDENT3--<b>d)</b> second quarter or district <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1502;&#1460;&#1513;&#1473;&#1456;&#1504;&#1462;&#1492; </span> mishneh, mish-neh&#39;; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=8138&page=1\">H8138</a>; properly, a repetition, i.e. a duplicate (copy of a document), or a double (in amount); by implication, a second (in order, rank, age, quality or location):&#8212;college, copy, double, fatlings, next, second (order), twice as much.";
