Lex["05319"] = "naphtuwl {naf-tool'}|AV - wrestling 1; 1|from 06617|TWOT - 1857c|noun masculine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> wrestlings <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1504;&#1463;&#1508;&#1456;&#1514;&#1468;&#1493;&#1468;&#1500; </span> napht&#251;wl, naf-tool&#39;; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=6617&page=1\">H6617</a>; properly, wrestled; but used (in the plural) transitively, a struggle:&#8212;wrestling.";
