Lex["06307"] = "Paddan {pad-dawn'}|AV - Padanaram 10, Padan 1; 11|from an unused root meaning to extend|TWOT - 1735|noun proper locative|<br><br>Padan or Padan-aram = \"field\"<BR> INDENT0--<b>1)</b> a plain or tableland in northern Mesopotamia in Aram, a region of Syria <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1508;&#1468;&#1463;&#1491;&#1468;&#1464;&#1503;</span> Padd&#226;n, pad-dawn&#39;; from an unused root meaning to extend; a plateau; or <span style=\"font-size:150%\">&#1508;&#1468;&#1463;&#1491;&#1468;&#1463;&#1503; &#1488;&#1458;&#1512;&#1464;&#1501;</span> Paddan &#x2BC;&#x102;r&#xE2;m; from the same and Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=758&page=1\">H758</a>; the table-land of Aram; Paddan or Paddan-Aram, a region of Syria:&#8212;Padan, Padan-aram.";
