Lex["06381"] = "pala' {paw-law'}|AV - (wondrous, marvellous...) work 18, wonders 9, marvellous 8, wonderful 8, ...things 6, hard 5, wondrous 3, wondrously 2,<BR>marvellously 2, performing 2, misc 8; 71|A primitive root|TWOT - 1768|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to be marvellous, be wonderful, be surpassing, be extraordinary, separate by distinguishing action INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Niphal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to be beyond one's power, be difficult to do INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to be difficult to understand INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to be wonderful, be extraordinary INDENT12-- <b>a)</b> marvellous (participle) INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Piel) to separate (an offering) INDENT3--<b>c)</b> (Hiphil) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to do extraordinary or hard or difficult thing INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to make wonderful, do wondrously INDENT3--<b>d)</b> (Hithpael) to show oneself wonderful or marvellous <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1508;&#1468;&#1464;&#1500;&#1464;&#1488; </span> p&#226;l&#226;&#700;, paw-law&#39;; a primitive root; properly, perhaps to separate, i.e. distinguish (literally or figuratively); by implication, to be (causatively, make) great, difficult, wonderful:&#8212;accomplish, (arise...too, be too) hard, hidden, things too high, (be, do, do a, shew) marvelous(-ly, -els, things, work), miracles, perform, separate, make singular, (be, great, make) wonderful(-ers, -ly, things, works), wondrous (things, works, -ly).";
