Lex["07599"] = "sha'an {shaw-an'}|AV - at ease 2, quiet 2, rest 1; 5|A primitive root|TWOT - 2304|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> (Pilel) to be at ease, be at peace, rest, rest securely, be quiet <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1513;&#1473;&#1464;&#1488;&#1463;&#1503; </span> sh&#226;&#700;an, shaw-an'; a primitive root; to loll, i.e. be peaceful:&#8212;be at ease, be quiet, rest. See also Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=1052&page=1\">H1052</a>.";
