Lex["08251"] = "shiqquwts {shik-koots'} or shiqquts {shik-koots'}|AV - abomination 20, detestable things 5, detestable 1,<BR>abominable filth 1, abominable idols 1; 28|from 08262|TWOT - 2459b|noun masculine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> detestable thing or idol, abominable thing, abomination, idol, detested thing <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1513;&#1473;&#1460;&#1511;&#1468;&#1493;&#1468;&#1509; </span> shiqq&#251;wts, shik-koots&#39;; or <span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1513;&#1473;&#1460;&#1511;&#1468;&#1467;&#1509; </span> shiqquts; from Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=8262&page=1\">H8262</a>; disgusting, i.e. filthy; especially idolatrous or (concretely) an idol:&#8212;abominable filth (idol, -ation), detestable (thing).";
