Lex["08446"] = "tuwr {toor}|AV - search 11, search out 3, spy out 2, seek 2, chapmen + 0582 1,<BR>descry 1, espied 1, excellent 1, merchantmen + 0582 1; 23|A primitive root|TWOT - 2500|verb| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> to seek, search out, spy out, explore<BR> INDENT3--<b>a)</b> (Qal) INDENT7--<b>1)</b> to seek out, select, find out how to do something INDENT7--<b>2)</b> to spy out, explore INDENT12-- <b>a)</b> explorers, spies (participle) INDENT7--<b>3)</b> to go about INDENT12-- <b>a)</b> merchant, trader (participle) INDENT3--<b>b)</b> (Hiphil) to make a search, make a reconnaissance <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1514;&#1468;&#1493;&#1468;&#1512; </span> t&#251;wr, toor; a primitive root; to meander (causatively, guide) about, especially for trade or reconnoitring:&#8212;chap(-man), sent to descry, be excellent, merchant(-man), search (out), seek, (e-) spy (out).";
