Lex["08577"] = "tanniyn {tan-neen'} or tanniym (Ezek 29:3) {tan-neem'}|AV - dragon 21, serpent 3, whale 3, sea monster 1; 28|intensive from the same as 08565|TWOT - 2528b|noun masculine| INDENT0--<b>1)</b> dragon, serpent, sea monster INDENT3--<b>a)</b> dragon or dinosaur INDENT3--<b>b)</b> sea or river monster INDENT3--<b>c)</b> serpent, venomous snake <br /><BR /><hr /> INDENT0--<b>Strong\'s Definition</b><BR><BR> INDENT0--<span style=\"font-size:150%\"> &#1514;&#1468;&#1463;&#1504;&#1468;&#1460;&#1497;&#1503; </span> tann&#238;yn, tan-neen&#39;; or <span style=\"font-size:150%\">&#1514;&#1468;&#1463;&#1504;&#1468;&#1460;&#1497;&#1501;</span> tann&#xEE;ym; (Ezekiel 29:3), intensive from the same as Strong\'s <a href=\"strongs_hebrew.html?strongs=8565&page=1\">H8565</a>; a marine or land monster, i.e. sea-serpent or jackal:&#8212;dragon, sea-monster, serpent, whale.";
